packages/escher-driver/src/schema.rs:275-307); then the three asked of the session itself, joined at 2026-10-10-driver-cli as a further widening of that set, ratified by the founder (2026-10-10): `start` (`app`; result `label`, `pid`, `idle_expiry_s`), `status` (no argument; result those three and `served`) and `stop` (no argument; result `stopped`); then, since 2026-10-12-self-description, the one asked of the tool itself, a further widening of that set ratified by the founder (2026-10-12, «help — десятый глагол», by question dialog in the overseer session, relayed verbatim by the overseer): `help` (no argument; result `verbs` · `node_keys` · `key_names` · `busy_classes` · `causes` · `exit_statuses` · `session_errors`, each field with its help; packages/escher-driver/src/schema.rs:372-428) — each a `VerbSpec { name, level, help, args, fields }` of `ArgSpec { name, kind, required, help }` and `FieldSpec { name, kind, always, help }`, found by `verb(name) -> Option<&'static VerbSpec>` on its exact name only. `ArgKind` is `Id` (1 to `MAX_ID_BYTES` = 1024 bytes of text) · `Text` (0 to `MAX_TEXT_BYTES` = 4096 bytes) · `Key` (one name of `KEY_NAMES`: `tab` · `enter` · `escape` · `backspace` · `delete` · `space` · `arrow-up` · `arrow-down` · `arrow-left` · `arrow-right` · `home` · `end`) · `Flag` · `Milliseconds` (a whole number, 1 to `MAX_MILLISECONDS` = 60000) · `Name` (1 to 32 bytes of `a-z`, `0-9` and `-` — `start`'s `app`, the sixth kind, since 2026-10-10-driver-cli). The five acting verbs' result fields are `settled` (flag), `busy` (one of `BUSY_CLASSES` — `render` · `layout` · `loads` — present only when `settled` is false), `added` and `changed` (nodes, each keyed by the thirteen keys `NODE_FIELDS` names: `id` · `parent` · `role` · `name` · `enabled` · `checked` · `value` · `selected` · `pressed` · `invalid` · `focused` · `bounds` · `differs` — nine until 2026-10-10-snapshot-states added the three after `value`, the constant's type moving from `[&str; 9]` to `[&st